{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "満開っ!🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の長嶋凛桜(ながしまりお)です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も読みに来てくれてありがとう☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobxuOLV6.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは2025年ありがとうございました!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんにとって今年はどんな1年でしたか?"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よく今年を漢字一文字で表すと?なんて質問を聞くことが多い時期ですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一文字では表せないくらい、\nそれくらい濃い1年でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "普通の高校生が東京に出てきて乃木坂46として活動して"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "憧れの先輩方と同じ舞台に立って"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなにも自分自身が変わる1年はきっと後にも先にも無いだろうと思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "去年の私 と 今の私"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会って話したらどうなるかな💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今の私はあの時の私から見てどんな人なんだろう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どこか変わっているのかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "顔は大人っぽくなったかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "考え方は大人になったのかな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いい意味で変わっていたらいいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そう思います。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2025年は乃木坂46のことがもっと大好きになった1年でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メンバーとして内側から見る乃木坂46の世界"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなにも愛で溢れていていいのかと思うほど温かくて優しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "目の前には眩しいほど輝いている先輩方がいます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だけど輝いている分、その裏には 沢山の努力があるということ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "色々な壁が立ちはだかる度に\n先輩方はこれを乗り越えて来たんだと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この1年間実感してきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも笑顔が絶えなくて\n嬉しいことも辛いことも一緒に分かち合ってきた同期、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "近くで支えて真剣に向き合ってくださるスタッフの皆さん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして溢れんばかりの愛を伝えてくださる\nファンの皆さん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんのお陰で素敵な景色を見ることができて自分の知らない一面も知ることが出来ました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そうだなぁ\n今年の漢字一文字､､､\n今この文章を書いていて分かったきがします"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年の漢字一文字は｢愛｣です!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に沢山の｢愛｣に触れて｢愛｣を受け取った1年でした。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからこそ来年はその｢愛｣を自分で生み出して周りに届けられる人になりたいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2025年\nありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob9iEbWE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobwXZIB9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobuiUIpZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆様、良いお年をお迎えください❀.*ﾟ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書くね☺︎"}], "source": "official"}